    "desc": "Displays volume based on daily claim receipts for up to two years. \n•\tPlacing the mouse over a date will display the claim count for that day. \n•\tTo view information for a specific date, select the desired date on the widget. The Widgets will adjust to reflect information for that specific date only. Utilizing filter features will only affect that user’s view.\n•\tUsing the scroll filter below this widget will filter down daily claim volumes for specific timeframes. Using the scroll filter feature will only affect this widget. To filter all corresponding widgets by grouped selection, left click and drag across the desired information. Click select. All correlating widgets will adjust. \n•\tTo filter all corresponding widgets by grouped selection, left click and drag across the desired information. Click select. All correlating widgets will adjust.\n•\tTo clear the filter from a widget, select clear selection. To restore the work session dashboard and clear any filters, select the options icon located at the top right corner of the dialog. Select Restore Dashboard.",
